B.Pj=new A.aX("asymmetric_friction","Asymmetric Friction","Designers make the action they want you to take incredibly easy, while burying the opt-out option under layers of confusing menus.","Privacy Bypass Architects","Take the extra 30 seconds to find the 'Reject All' button rather than surrendering your data.",B.c2,B.Qa,"",null,!1)
